  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: You're accustomed to the desolate wilds of Belkzen and able to blend
    into the sparse shadows of craggy rocks and quench your thirst with drops of
    water. You might be a member of an isolated orc hold, traveling mercenary, or
    wandering warrior from nearby human settlements. Choose two attribute boosts.
    One must be to Constitution or Wisdom , and one is a free attribute boost. You're
    trained in the Survival skill and the Badlands Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Forager]
    skill feat.
